{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":23591,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793474258010,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":1977,"episodeCount":30,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iRARrGUxqru0OXfhHkFZCXO8MEZ.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"626462","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Memorabile compleanno a.k.a. Il compleanno di Charlotte","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"１２歳の誕生日を友達に花火で祝ってもらい、大喜びのシャル。父アンドレと二人きりの誕生日でシャルは父親から亡くなったはずの母親が生きていることを聞かされる。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1977-10-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zmgVGV0UMY5CXRwu2f1xNxmz8sx.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zmgVGV0UMY5CXRwu2f1xNxmz8sx.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"626463","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Non voglio la mamma a.k.a. L'amore materno","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"まだ母親が生きていると知ったシャルはショックだった。母親に会ったことがないシャルは友達のベッキーやサビーの母親から自分の母親を想像するが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1977-11-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8Xw4SA9GTLOIxo92VEXgWDrdCwm.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8Xw4SA9GTLOIxo92VEXgWDrdCwm.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"626464","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Un gran brutto sogno a.k.a. Un brutto sogno","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"母親がフランスからやって来る、シャルの心ははずんでいた。牧場で待っていられないシャルは港まで行くことになったが、迎えに行く日の朝になって大変な事が起こる…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1977-11-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qX7qYRzASkOyAMX3y4CRq4u5x8n.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qX7qYRzASkOyAMX3y4CRq4u5x8n.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"626465","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Una stella brilla nel cuore a.k.a. Spica, la stella che brilla nel cuore","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"シャルの父親が亡くなる。シャルにはとても信じられなかった。フランスから到着する予定の母親の船が嵐により遅れていた。友達のサンディーと一緒にケベックの港へ両親を探しにいくが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1977-11-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hKkJQx8eBhbFfUuVjK4CdIKq7p0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hKkJQx8eBhbFfUuVjK4CdIKq7p0.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"626466","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Papà è ancora vivo a.k.a. Il papà è sempre con me","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ケベックの港でナイトから父親の死を知らされたシャルロットは、悲しみのうちにスピカと一緒にアンドレ牧場に帰る。一人になっても父親の残した牧場を守っていこうと決心したシャル。しかし、シャルの家にガースンがくることになってしまう…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1977-11-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/w8PIbcrZGCFM2t2P4Z73p6qzasF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w8PIbcrZGCFM2t2P4Z73p6qzasF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"626467","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Una carrozza venuta dal cielo a.k.a. Una carrozza da sogno dal Paradiso","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"父親の葬式を済ませたシャルは動物たちの冬じたくで大忙しだった。そんなある日、シャルの家にケベックのシャトーフロントナックホテルからシャルを迎えに馬車が来る。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1977-12-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qPERgC2oQUqHSXkC90z0dHEL9iw.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qPERgC2oQUqHSXkC90z0dHEL9iw.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"626468","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Una principessa in una fattoria a.k.a. La principessa del ranch","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ケベックの街の見物を終えたシャルはサンディーたちの待つ牧場に帰るが、シャルの身に大変な事がまちうけていた…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1977-12-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fxN0RH8ph7NYoOESnhym1VZbrZ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fxN0RH8ph7NYoOESnhym1VZbrZ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"626469","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Il cavaliere nella neve a.k.a. Il cavaliere nella neve","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"シャルの牧場を手伝うことになったナイトを、ゴードンたちは快く思っていなかった。とうとうカウボーイたちを使って追い出そうとするが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1977-12-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yuixlNkJ3vK1AbbaNoF63tXHkDM.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yuixlNkJ3vK1AbbaNoF63tXHkDM.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"626470","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Una lettera a Natale a.k.a. La lettera di Natale","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"アンドレ牧場も冬を迎えすっかり雪に覆われ、もうすぐクリスマス。プリンスエドワード島へシャルの母親を探しに行ったナイトからシャルへ手紙が届く。しかし、その手紙が何者かに隠されてしまう。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1977-12-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6Z5k8V4sizYgL4LmhCUIh28wOay.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6Z5k8V4sizYgL4LmhCUIh28wOay.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"626471","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Il carnevale della neve a.k.a. Il festival della neve","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"母親を見つけてくれたナイトを訪ねてシャルはサンディーとケベックの街へ急ぐ。ケベックの街はちょうど雪まつりの最中だった。そこでシャルは思いがけない人と会うのだった。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1977-01-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2i3cqgEPWvrEiZ4WNeOyS7FMAoL.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2i3cqgEPWvrEiZ4WNeOyS7FMAoL.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"626472","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Un inviato da Parigi a.k.a. Un messaggero da Parigi","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"父親のいとこのアルベールがフランスからやって来た。母親がフランスに帰ってシャルを待っているという事がわかり、シャルはフランスへ行く事を決意するが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-01-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dWrvQ7bCR1hNBUMmRGSyT9YGCEz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dWrvQ7bCR1hNBUMmRGSyT9YGCEz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"626473","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Sull’Oceano Atlantico a.k.a. Piccole ali sull'Oceano Atlantico","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"シャルは、母親のシモーヌがカナダにいるが、アルベールに騙されてフランス行きの船に乗せられてしまう。なんとかカナダへ帰ろうと少年船員のルネに頼み込んで救命ボートを下ろしてもらおうとするが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-01-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3nKLEYzsOvBMNUmFRdaKjOHwCFh.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3nKLEYzsOvBMNUmFRdaKjOHwCFh.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"626474","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Una vera o falsa madre? a.k.a. La fuga","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"シャルはフランスへ着いたらすぐにカナダへ戻る貨物船に乗るようにと、コック長のマテオに教えられる。しかし、アルベールの監視の目が厳しくて乗ることができない。ルネはシャルに少年船員の服を着せて上陸させようとする。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-01-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rylQxBJvXllSdu9t9aFC3DcEQvT.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rylQxBJvXllSdu9t9aFC3DcEQvT.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"626475","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Detesto i nobili a.k.a. L'inganno","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"１２年ぶりに母親に会えたが、シャルはうれしさがこみ上げてこなかった。本当に自分の母親かどうかと疑いを持つ。召使いたちに聞いてみると本当の母親だと言うが、そんな中でルイという少年が…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-02-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1sZphZvf0FaYRrXMdgFLsgA4fV4.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1sZphZvf0FaYRrXMdgFLsgA4fV4.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"626476","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Charlotte incontra la mamma a.k.a. Verso Cherbourg","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"本当の母親がカナダにいると信じたシャルは、モントバーンの屋敷をなんとか抜け出してカナダの牧場へ帰ろうと決心する。ある夜、シャルとスピカは暗闇にまぎれて窓から抜け出そうとするが、見張りの男たちに見つかってしまう。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-02-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yHnEThqcVB60wBfH4sLPIRI1hbB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yHnEThqcVB60wBfH4sLPIRI1hbB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"626477","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Mamma! a.k.a. Incontro","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"モントバーンの屋敷を逃げ出したシャルはルイとカナダ行きの船へ乗るため、シェルブールの港に向かう。そこで、港の似顔絵描きからルイを助けてくれたひとが本当の母親だったと知る。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-02-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pLoROh1tAYWZq3uR0PGVoVGHjjv.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pLoROh1tAYWZq3uR0PGVoVGHjjv.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"626478","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Tre quarti di felicità a.k.a. Una felicità da sette e mezzo","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"１２年ぶりに母親に会えたシャルは幸せだったが、母親はシャル一人をパリに置いて一人でカナダへ向かってしまう…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-02-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uchtm251Oqy04hKLTZOAfzGF2kq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uchtm251Oqy04hKLTZOAfzGF2kq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"626479","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Il passato brucia a.k.a. La piccola fonte tra le fiamme","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"おじいさんと一緒に暮らすようになったシャルを見て、モントバーン家の財産を狙っているアルベールとミレーヌはおもしろくない。そんなある日、馬小屋が火事になる。火事の原因はシャルのせいにされてしまう…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-03-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ApYveQLdJnChtStT7l8Jv5G9wql.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ApYveQLdJnChtStT7l8Jv5G9wql.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/18"},{"id":"626480","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Addio Parigi a.k.a. Addio, Parigi!","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"シャルはカナダへ帰れる喜びでいっぱいだった。そんなある日、突然モローケの令嬢マリーが訪れる。そして、シャルのことを人殺しと叫ぶのだった…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-03-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AwfuKT4QVeN3zQcmUFGUiWWyXSO.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AwfuKT4QVeN3zQcmUFGUiWWyXSO.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"626481","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Una piccola fattoria sull’oceano a.k.a. Un piccolo ranch in mezzo al mare","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"カナダへ向かう船の中で、シャルに対するマリーの嫌がらせが始まる。シャルと一緒のハムスターのスピカが恐ろしい伝染病のペスト菌を撒き散らすから海へ投げ捨てろとマリーは船長に言う。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-03-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dUiyO1CGVPvkeh3CSDrK1WlRCIg.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dUiyO1CGVPvkeh3CSDrK1WlRCIg.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/20"},{"id":"626482","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Ritorno alla fattoria a.k.a. Il ranch di Andrè","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"シャルは念願のアンドレ牧場に帰ってきた。久しぶりにフロックやラッキーたちに会うため、シャルは牛小屋に行くが、ラッキーは死んでいた…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-03-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z6XFpUACQk23KBNFglquEXWZVvN.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z6XFpUACQk23KBNFglquEXWZVvN.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/21"},{"id":"626483","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"La fattoria perduta a.k.a. Le luci del ranch si spengono","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"アンドレ牧場の牛乳をシャトーフロントナックホテルへ大量に売ることに成功したシャルは、この調子なら遠からずゴードンの借金を返せると張り切って牛乳を運ぶ。ところが、急にホテルから牛乳は買わないと言われてしまう…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-04-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u0WVq8L95LbsoeuAmN7eSMrFqWw.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u0WVq8L95LbsoeuAmN7eSMrFqWw.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/22"},{"id":"626484","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Una notte sotto le stelle a.k.a. Dormire sotto le stelle","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"約束の日までにゴードンに借金が返せなかったらシャルと母親はアンドレ牧場を出て行かなくてはならない。牛や羊を連れて旅に出たシャルたちは泊まる場所もなく野宿することになる…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-04-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7mECzWZXYxRV7HGAJHSyFVRLD4r.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7mECzWZXYxRV7HGAJHSyFVRLD4r.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/23"},{"id":"626485","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"Due conflitti a.k.a. Due lotte","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"シモーヌはガラガラヘビにかまれたナイトを助けるために、鹿の肝臓があれば助かる言う。しかし、なかなか鹿が見あたらない。トムソンは鹿のかわりに羊のフロックに銃を向ける…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-04-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6UeoCDROZFsQgz5ec3L3JFqcMoD.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6UeoCDROZFsQgz5ec3L3JFqcMoD.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/24"},{"id":"626486","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":25,"title":{"value":"Una lettera da Fiocco a.k.a. Una lettera da Fiocco","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ある日、シャルたちが世話になっているトムソン牧場へ、やって来てたマリーから、アンドレ牧場は火事で全滅になったと知らされる…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-04-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1Nn7KMzbHAHcrWFm7lQ7vXke1Ag.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1Nn7KMzbHAHcrWFm7lQ7vXke1Ag.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/25"},{"id":"626487","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":26,"title":{"value":"Il tramonto di Marie a.k.a. Marie nel rosso del tramonto","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"フロッグからの知らせでアンドレ牧場が火事でないことを知ったシャルたちは、動物たちを連れて帰りの道を急ぐ。帰りに出会った見知らぬ老人は、アンドレ牧場のシャルロットという娘は自分の娘だと聞かされる…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-04-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/80rHTiSKddojm3ZvMw7JJy5BhV4.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/80rHTiSKddojm3ZvMw7JJy5BhV4.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/26"},{"id":"626488","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":27,"title":{"value":"Lo spettro di papà a.k.a. Il fantasma di papà","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"沢山の人たちのおかげで無事に、アンドレ牧場に戻ることができたシャルだったが、突然ナイトが旅に出ると言い出す…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-05-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xCMfdBdH73UWe9hp0QEWkhU71X0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xCMfdBdH73UWe9hp0QEWkhU71X0.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/27"},{"id":"626489","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":28,"title":{"value":"La mamma farà il sindaco a.k.a. La mamma come sindaco","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"シャルの村で村長の選挙が行われることになり、選挙にゴードンが立候補する。ゴードンに村長になって欲しくない村人たちはシャルの母親に立候補を頼む…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-05-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/65CWuxLTv8qUTMYuqozZtoj0JxG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/65CWuxLTv8qUTMYuqozZtoj0JxG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23591/season/1/episode/28"},{"id":"626490","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":29,"title":{"value":"Un addio a Prato Fiorito a.k.a. L'addio a Prato di fiori","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"医者から、病気で一年しか生きられないと言われていたルイは、アラスカへの無理な旅がたたって重体になる。そんなルイは、もめている村長問題を解決すると言い出す…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1978-05-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ladYA4mvFWprXrhb3rkcptaA7Sy.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ladYA4mvFWprXrhb3rkcptaA7Sy.jpg","languag